          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10218
        },
        {
          "text": "I hate this man",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10346
        },
        {
          "text": "I hate him. I repeat it to myself like a mantra as he carries me up the stairs",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10363
        }
      ],
      "words": 56
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I have to stay detached",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13057
        },
        {
          "text": "not just for my parents’ sake and not just because this man is a known monster. But because no matter how many horrible ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13082
        },
        {
          "text": "or maybe ever could. And I’m terrified of how long it will be before that starts twisting into something I can’t take ba",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13304
        }
      ],
      "words": 75
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Just this once, I tell myself",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14579
        },
        {
          "text": "it’s my birthday; I can let myself feel it",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14610
